{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1110813001:0":{"text":"We've lost almost seventy percent of the cargo, all the laborers, and those young Maulers who came with the caravans are also gone!","source_cn":"货物损失了七成，力工一个也没剩下，还有那些跟队来的蛮血...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96EEC2DFF5624F44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110813002:1":{"text":"How am I supposed to explain this to the Mauler clans on the other side of the desert?! We're not just dealing with financial loss here. People are missing!","source_cn":"金钱损失也就算了，人丢了，我怎么向沙漠那边的蛮血氏族交代？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83CC93EBFEC6A54F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110813003:0":{"text":"We're going to rescue everyone—our kin from the <style=\"highlight\">Thundra Clan</style>, the young Maulers of the Uru Clan, and your laborers.","source_cn":"我们要救出所有人，<style=highlight>雷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02A1F36DEEC787E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110813004:1":{"text":"Giving up now means forsaking all our honor!","source_cn":"现在放弃，没有荣耀可言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2912C5F186A20391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110813005:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">All the young and strong ones have been taken by the Quicksand Claws!</style> Who's left to rescue them now?!","source_cn":"<style=highlight>年轻力壮的人都被流沙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA739BADB4AAF92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110813006:0":{"text":"Us.","source_cn":"——我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F2DE5D45F3E1093","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110813007:1":{"text":"Young Mauler, the scent on you tells the tale of another clan.","source_cn":"年轻的蛮血，你身上的气味讲述着另一个氏族的故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2E5D355C5412B95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110813008:0":{"text":"I'm from the Uru Clan. My kin have been taken by the Quicksand Claws.","source_cn":"乌尔氏族。我的族人被流沙之爪带走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65404CE5F1E15632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110813009:0":{"text":"So, the future leader those Mauler kids talked about is you?","source_cn":"你，那些蛮血孩子说的未来领袖就是你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278E7B0BBB2CBFAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110813010:0":{"text":"But you... you're just a kid yourself. We're discussing plans to rescue them. The Quicksand Claws operate stealthily and they outnumber us. We can't act recklessly right now.","source_cn":"但你……也只是个半大的孩子而已。我们在商讨救人的计划，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27E2FA539F17092D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1110813010":{"text":"But you... you're just a kid yourself. We're discussing plans to rescue them. The Quicksand Claws operate stealthily and they outnumber us. We can't act recklessly right now.","source_cn":"但你……也只是个半大的孩子而已。我们在商讨救人的计划，流沙之爪行动诡秘，而且人数极多，现在不能贸然行动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27E2FA539F17092D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110813011:0":{"text":"Taking care of them doesn't require any planning. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> and I can handle it.","source_cn":"对付他们，用不着计划。我和<style=stress>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF4286763FDBD09EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Taking care of them doesn't require any planning. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> and I can handle it.","female":"Taking care of them doesn't require any planning. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> and I can handle it.","variant_male_record_index":"122652","variant_female_record_index":"122653","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110813012:0":{"text":"Even grown warriors from our clan get snatched when they're alone. You're still too young and weak.","source_cn":"成长中的领袖，连我们雷矛聚落的成年蛮血都会在落单时被绑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC7251F5B834440","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110813013:0":{"text":"Weak? My friend Alsa and I are the victors of the Warsong Festival.","source_cn":"弱小？我和我的同伴阿尔萨是战歌节的胜者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x889E86F7E7C13F9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110813014:0":{"text":"Those who lack the courage to save their companions are the true weaklings.","source_cn":"没有勇气去拯救同伴的人，才是弱者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEDB245A281B7A21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1110813014":{"text":"Those who lack the courage to save their companions are the true weaklings.","source_cn":"没有勇气去拯救同伴的人，才是弱者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEDB245A281B7A21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110813015:0":{"text":"The look in your eyes is unique...","source_cn":"……你们的眼神，很不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21F30A2CF0F4F322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female"